#[navbar]

#[section, $md:
    @../ (Documentation) / Moth template files

    # Moth template files

    A `.mtf` file puts Markdown directly inside Moth's compile-time template
    system. It needs no frontmatter, embedded script block or separate template
    engine.

    The compiler exports the folded result as `content`. Use plain `.md` for
    portable Markdown and normal `.moth` when the file needs declarations,
    dependencies or runtime work.
]

